    "원자료 R02147의 적용 맥락: Using scanner data from a national supermarket chain’s six stores in one U.S. metropolitan area (2003–2006), the paper studies individual cashiers’ productivity measured as items scanned per second in ten-minute intervals. Units are cashier–ten-minute observations; setting is unionized stores with fixed hourly wages, unsystematic bi‑weekly scheduling, known register locations and orientations. Causal analyses exploit within‑day changes in co‑worker composition from staggered shifts and spatial monitoring to identify peer effects."
